      "summary": "Compactor StatefulSet 定义，运行 iedb 容器并以 compactor 角色启动，负责在子进程中执行 Parquet 文件合并（压缩），配置存储卷声明、健康检查和资源限制。",
      "tags": ["kubernetes", "statefulset", "compaction", "deployment"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
